                <td style="padding: 0.85rem 1rem;">Immediately displays twin peaks, valleys, and gaps</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="padding: 0.85rem 1rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-text-primary);">Alternative Companion</td>
